license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/pavanamthomas/pytorch-deep-learning-lab
url: https://github.com/pavanamthomas/pytorch-deep-learning-lab
abstract: >
  Neural-network mathematics connected to a transparent NumPy multilayer
  perceptron and checked against PyTorch autograd. Finite-difference
  gradient checks, designed failure cases (vanishing and exploding
  gradients, dead ReLU, BatchNorm train/eval mismatch, class imbalance),
  and tiny synthetic models. Not a pretrained-model zoo and not an
  empirical benchmark.
keywords:
  - deep learning
  - backpropagation
  - autograd
  - finite differences
  - PyTorch
  - NumPy
  - initialization
  - optimization
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-20"
